legal_text = "[center][b][color=#8FBCBB]SpeedBurst™ Standard Edition: Terms of Accelerated Existence (TAE)[/color][/b][/center]

Congratulations on equipping the [b]SpeedBurst™ Standard Edition[/b] — the baseline, regulation-compliant, no-frills tactical locomotion enhancer for [i]persons of neutral interest[/i].

This item grants the user a [color=#A3BE8C]+X% increase in apparent movement velocity[/color], subject to the following conditions:

• You move faster, until you don’t  
• Momentum not guaranteed in emotionally weighted situations  
• Results may vary by terrain, self-esteem, and gravitational anomalies

[b][u]Use Restrictions:[/u][/b]
SpeedBurst™ Standard is engineered for the [i]undistinguished, unadorned, and economically reasonable[/i]. Side effects include:
• Mild satisfaction  
• Efficient traversal  
• Feelings of being \"just fast enough\" but never remarkable

This product does not sparkle, glitter, wink, giggle, or compliment your shoes. If you want that, see [b]SpeedBurst™ Girl Edition™[/b].

[center][color=#BF616A]Efficiency has no gender. But it does have a price point.[/color][/center]"
